                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.51 Relief Credits/118: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washburn</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-29T22:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 29, 1928—10
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>27. Regret to inform you Congress adjourned today without acting upon Bill
                    authorizing subordination of lien and debt settlement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
